|----------|-------|--------|
| 🔴 CRITICAL | 1 | Exposed credentials in .env.test |
| 🟡 MEDIUM | 4 | Missing security headers, no input validation, no error handling, no rate limiting |
| 🟢 LOW | 2 | Hardcoded port, no HTTPS enforcement |

